# Frontend

- Use Next.js App Router, React, strict TypeScript, Tailwind, and Zod at boundaries.
- Keep Server/Client Component boundaries intentional and routes thin.
- Use TanStack Query for session/client server-state and URL state for shareable filters. Avoid global stores unless justified.
- Fetch through the BFF only. Never import Platform code, wire types, server config, or secrets.
- Build mobile-first and verify both mobile and desktop.
- Keep Casino, Live Casino, and Sportsbook visually dominant; favor game content over empty chrome.
- Reuse tokens and primitives. Preserve keyboard access, touch targets, semantics, and `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Do not use GIFs for core UI motion or drift into generic dashboard UI.
- Stake informs information architecture and density only. Shuffle and MyStake inform interaction ideas only.
- Never copy third-party branding, logos, assets, exact colors, or layouts.
